{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2bb0d3e930563ce89442baf1898afc9c0b4c26a449dbb39b30d69ce5701fb2da", "ja": "（海美がプロデュースした服のPRのため、\n雑誌のピンナップや特集記事の写真を撮影する……）", "zh": "（为了宣传海美设计的服装，要拍摄杂志插页和专题报道的照片……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "a808f05752c23a89df69b51678d627d142729b8fa31fef9579f8ee2e08d0c573", "ja": "{$P$}。\n今日の撮影って、デートしてる感じで撮るんだよね？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n今天的拍摄，要拍出像是在约会的感觉，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bc824f4df7de6c680909fbc74c6771d6f1b4f2526687c5be97ece5529783f52d", "ja": "ああ。『初デート』を特集した記事にしたいから\nそういうテーマでって聞いてるよ。", "zh": "嗯。听说是要以“初次约会”为主题，做成一篇专题报道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "f1501cbd8f74046dd31ee7b61e340bbaa6901324ba4ca598f148a2b3327b3851", "ja": "そっかー……初デート……。んんん～……\nどういう感じで表情を作ればいいのかな？", "zh": "这样啊……初次约会……嗯嗯嗯～……\n要摆出什么样的表情才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "dbb78a87e7f35cd0f425d8a9d78afb3632e1a4ca53603a1fa25c36abd893476e", "ja": "漫画とかドラマで見たことはあるけど……\nそれを真似するだけじゃ、ダメなんだよね？", "zh": "虽然在漫画和电视剧里见过……但只是照着模仿，还是不行的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d89f7ea142c816a47229a84ba6178a189b85cd4bd6045d6cc4ac97f865080bfa", "ja": "うーん、ダメではないけど……。リアリティが\n感じられないなら、止めた方がいいかもな。", "zh": "嗯……倒也不是不行，只是……要是让人感觉不到真实感，或许还是别这样比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1006_p", "source_sha256": "302c654d378fc99883e4e114fc573d5b9a65513daaaae019921f84da708358c7", "ja": "写真を見た人に「海美とデートしてるみたい」って\n思ってもらえるのが一番だと思うから……。", "zh": "我觉得，最重要的是要让看照片的人觉得“好像在和海美约会”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "b94edfe638695938c6fc6a1c3918360cfbf50364a173e7199f4a3c9b1ea929ba", "ja": "だよねー。う～～～ん……あっ！", "zh": "对吧——。嗯～～～……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "5a731abba2c94591b165f75c6cf3c2dc08444bbe7ba940aa6bacce7bd3eadc73", "ja": "それなら、{$P$}が\n私と初めてデートするなら、どんなデートにしたい？", "zh": "既然这样，如果{$P$}要和我第一次约会，你想进行什么样的约会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "430fa0798da9b17409aee0b6fea7053c44ea6c37e356c093adc7851448d1c0a1", "ja": "具体的なイメージがあったら、何かつかめるかもって！\n劇場にいたら、みんなに聞けるんだけど……。", "zh": "如果有具体的形象，说不定就能抓住什么灵感！\n要是在剧场的话，还能问问大家，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2483e2954bae082b1ddc65164f69b2da6239dee1b84eb0aaded1296048fcce4a", "ja": "なるほど。ここにいるのは、俺だけだからか。\nはあ～、ビックリした……。", "zh": "原来如此。是因为这里只有我一个人啊。\n呼～吓我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6c0727bfda9dd17b8b796c6c504609836334c565ce5dfd76012a9773edc663fc", "ja": "そうだな、海美を連れていくなら……\n静かな場所で、ゆっくり散策したりするかな。", "zh": "是啊，要是带海美一起去的话……\n大概会找个安静的地方，慢慢逛逛吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "367a27a8d19ddca88b748ddba553a86d527cc02f914ace7930f3b751b1286604", "ja": "え？　散策するの？　デートなのに？", "zh": "诶？要去散步吗？明明是约会啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1014_p", "source_sha256": "721b0279f068a4eee49dd9bdd100a3384f5b1a3459a66d78685e24afc24f3426", "ja": "うっ！　そ、そうだよな……。\nもっとアクティブなことをイメージしたよな……。", "zh": "唔！也、也是啊……。\n你原本想象的是更有活力的安排吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "77dc58ca6d8d8cce86cdc5371d537265dcc13a8e36b3441e72925673493f3bf0", "ja": "ああっ、誤解しないで！　私は大歓迎だよ！\nお散歩とか好きだし、絶対楽しいよね！", "zh": "啊，别误会！我可是非常欢迎的哦！\n我喜欢散步之类的，肯定会很开心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "29ee35b2c68954fd578a29e984a0652f8d0d87f0ddd9f02a7101a7dcb89c859e", "ja": "でも……デートって、そういう感じでいいの？", "zh": "不过……约会就是这种感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "9fc71fc74c36c62645dc2040aa945d0d0e12129272bb1bee1754d583dc0ee0b9", "ja": "ふたりで恋愛映画を見たり、遊園地に行ったり、\nオシャレなカフェに入ったりとかしてたけど……。", "zh": "我们两个人一起看恋爱电影、去游乐园、去时髦的咖啡馆之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8664406cab5252126953ce10366f1c8dc3811b67eba7c04684b473b2ddb20964", "ja": "もちろんだよ。\n海美は、今言ったデートがしたいのか？", "zh": "当然可以啊。\n海美想去刚才说的那些地方约会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "4950d7943f1b4028d3d4e15f1046e95bfb72a55b590b1188c41739ce6b99a859", "ja": "ち、違うよ～！　今のは憧れみたいな感じで！\n私がしたいわけじゃ……いや、そうなのかな？　あれ？", "zh": "不、不是啦～！刚才只是有点憧憬的感觉！\n并不是我想要……不对，难道我确实想要？咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2ad1b2a89f5087e0e796c513b40b4f1135173e5c8ef5882b2157f9371f7e2740", "ja": "ははっ、答えはもう出てるみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，答案好像已经出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "e1ba18f208670edf43dd1ca8cbd98d18a8809792106c0ff9aaca20e85f4733c8", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとう！　私、\n撮影のイメージがつかめてきたかも！　あ、でも……。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你！我好像逐渐有拍摄的感觉了！啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0674_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "3f2f1a391621f632badf49774d1db73221ede7982d53a0557f84e926fdf3c27e", "ja": "相手がいた方がイメージしやすいから、その……\n{$P$}のこと、考えてていい？", "zh": "有搭档的话会更容易想象，所以那个……\n我可以想着{$P$}吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
